An bayar da cewa, ABCD lauje ne. AC da BD su ne giyagiyai biyu na shi. Muna da nufin bayyana waɗancan vectors ɗin \vec{AB} da \vec{AC} a cikin sharuɗɗan \vec{AD} da \vec{BD} kuma mu nuna cewa,
\vec{AC} + \vec{BD} = 2\vec{BC} \text{ da } \vec{AC} - \vec{BD} = 2\vec{AB}.

A cikin triangle ɗin \Delta ABD,
\vec{AD} = \vec{AB} + \vec{BD} \text{ [dokar triangle]}
\therefore \vec{AB} = \vec{AD} - \vec{BD} \text{.............(i)}
Sake a cikin triangle ɗin ACD, \vec{AC} = \vec{AD} + \vec{DC} \text{[dokar triangle]}
\text{[tun da, ABCD lauje ne, don haka } \vec{DC} = \vec{AB}]
= \vec{AD} + \vec{AD} - \vec{BD} [\because \vec{AB} = \vec{AD} - \vec{BD}]
\therefore \vec{AC} = 2\vec{AD} - \vec{BD} \text{.............(ii)}
Yanzu, \vec{AC} + \vec{BD} = 2\vec{AD} - \vec{BD} + \vec{BD}
\text{[Ƙara } \vec{BD} \text{ a dukkan bangarorin (ii)]}
= 2 \vec{AD}
\therefore \vec{AC} + \vec{BD} = 2 \vec{BC} \text{.............(iii)}
\text{[tun da, ABCD lauje ne, don haka } \vec{AD} = \vec{BC}]
Sake, \vec{AC} - \vec{BD} = (2\vec{AD} - \vec{BD}) - \vec{BD} \text{ [Ta amfani da (ii)]}
= 2\vec{AD} - 2 \vec{BD} = 2 (\vec{AD} - \vec{BD})
= 2\vec{AB} \text{ [Ta amfani da (i)]}
\therefore \vec{AC} - \vec{BD} = 2\vec{AB} \text{.............(iv)}
Yanzu, daga lissafin (i), (ii), (iii) da (iv) muna samun,
\vec{AB} = \vec{AD} - \vec{BD}
\vec{AC} = 2\vec{AD} - \vec{BD}
\vec{AC} + \vec{BD} = 2\vec{BC} \text{ da } \vec{AC} - \vec{BD} = 2\vec{AB} \text{ (An nuna)}

